<div class="bb-quote"><b>Arcanist Lupus wrote:</b><br /><blockquote class="bb-quote-body">Speaking of which, during the Defensive Blast I had the Treacherous Ape destroy my plating card; I expected that this would turn off the damage being dealt before it got to the Dreamer. &nbsp;After all, no types of damage are currently being reduced, right? &nbsp;But that didn&#39;t work, and Vanessa took 4 damage. &nbsp;Is this a bug, or is that how Defensive Blast is supposed to work?&nbsp;
