Sounds like a bug! We&#39;ll look into it.--The Weekly One-Shot uses a fixed random seed unless it says otherwise.

[/quote]

The currrent operation seems consistent with a similar issue I had a while ago (posted on the video game&#39;s forum) about Nightmist&#39;s Amulet of the Elder Gods with relation to the Citizen Tears+Citizen Blood combo.&nbsp; In that case, Citizen Tears must do damage equal to the number of cards discarded by that hero&#39;s player during that turn, but Nightmist&#39;s Amulet allows her to discard cards to redirect that damage (or to discard 1 card for no effect).&nbsp; Doing so does not change the amount of damage, even though more cards have been discarded during that turn.

I&#39;ve confirmed that this hasn&#39;t changed, and there are certainly one or two differeneces between the effects (e.g., the effect that alters the damage being done occurs during the attack instead of between multiple attacks), but I thought it might be worth mentioning it for comparison.
